==Catalan==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|ca}} {{term|arguere|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|arguo|arguō|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{ca-verb|ir|argü}}

# to [[argue]] a case etc.
# to [[discuss]]
# to [[indicate]]

====Conjugation====
